\">刀头对准螺丝槽，垂直用力旋转。</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"tool-item\">\n                <div class=\"tool-header\">\n                    <div class=\"tool-num\">3</div>\n                    <div class=\"tool-name\">测电笔</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder tool-img-box\">[测电笔图片]</div>\n                <div class=\"tool-desc-box\">\n                    <div class=\"desc-row\">\n                        <div class=\"desc-label\">用途:</div>\n                        <div class=\"desc-text\">检测火线</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"desc-row\">\n                        <div class=\"desc-label\">用法:</div>\n                        <div class=\"desc-text\">手指接触笔尾金属，笔尖接触导线，氖管亮表示为火线。</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"tool-item\">\n                <div class=\"tool-header\">\n                    <div class=\"tool-num\">4</div>\n                    <div class=\"tool-name\">万用表</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder tool-img-box\">[万用表图片]</div>\n                <div class=\"tool-desc-box\">\n                    <div class=\"desc-row\">\n                        <div class=\"desc-label\">用途:</div>\n                        <div class=\"desc-text\">测电压、电流、电阻等</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"desc-row\">\n                        <div class=\"desc-label\">用法:</div>\n                        <div class=\"desc-text\">根据测量需求选择档位，表笔正确接线后进行测量。</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"tool-item\">\n                <div class=\"tool-header\">\n                    <div class=\"tool-num\">5</div>\n                    <div class=\"tool-name\">钢丝钳</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder tool-img-box\">[钢丝钳图片]</div>\n                <div