ial-item\">\n                <div class=\"tutorial-title\">4. 电烙铁焊接</div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder tutorial-img-box\">[电烙铁使用演示]</div>\n                <div class=\"tutorial-desc\">电烙铁加热后，先加热焊点，再送入焊锡丝，待焊锡融化后移开焊锡丝。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"tutorial-item\">\n                <div class=\"tutorial-title\">5. 绝缘胶带包扎</div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder tutorial-img-box\">[胶带使用演示]</div>\n                <div class=\"tutorial-desc\">将胶带拉紧缠绕在接头处，覆盖所有裸露导体，确保绝缘可靠。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"tutorial-item\">\n                <div class=\"tutorial-title\">6. 热缩管使用</div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder tutorial-img-box\">[热缩管使用演示]</div>\n                <div class=\"tutorial-desc\">将热缩管套在接头处，用热风枪加热均匀，直至完全收缩贴合。</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Footer / Safety -->\n    <div class=\"safety-section\">\n        <div class=\"safety-left\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder safety-icon-large\">[⚠]</div>\n            <div class=\"safety-left-text\">安全使用提示</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"safety-middle\">\n            <div class=\"safety-item\">\n                <div class=\"s-marker circle\">1</div>\n                <div>施工前务必断电，确认无电再操作。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"safety-item\">\n                <div class=\"s-marker square\">4</div>\n                <div>电工刀使用时刀口朝外，避免划伤。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"safety-item\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder s-marker icon-ph\">[✔]</div>\n                <div>使用测电笔、万用表前先确认工具完好。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"safety-item\">\n                <div class=\"s-marker square\">5</div>\n                <div>高处作业注意安全，佩戴安全带。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"safety-item\">\n                <div class=\"placeholder s-marker icon-ph\">[箱]</div>\n                <div>工具使用后及时整理，避免遗失或损坏。</div>\n            </div>\n            <div cla